{
  "declaredLength": 6732,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "How can she be so strong with such a weird\nattitude? I just don’t get it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure, she’s got the type advantage, but that\ndoesn’t explain why I can’t ever seem to win...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And what’s so “elite” about her, anyway? She’s\ntotally cheating with those Jacinthe zones...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Goodness, Lebanne!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F0064006E006500730073002C0020004C006500620061006E006E0065002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“Weird attitude”? “Cheating”? What could you\npossibly mean by that, hm?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh... What?! I-is that what you heard?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068002E002E002E00200057006800610074003F002100200049002D00690073002000740068006100740020007700680061007400200079006F0075002000680065006100720064003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There must be something wrong with your Holo\nCaster, Lady Jacinthe!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065007200650020006D00750073007400200062006500200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002000770072006F006E00670020007700690074006800200079006F0075007200200048006F006C006F000A004300610073007400650072002C0020004C0061006400790020004A006100630069006E007400680065002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was merely marveling over your “sheer\naptitude” and saying that your Jacinthe zones<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nare totally “charming”!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see... My Holo Caster is to blame, you say.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300650065002E002E002E0020004D007900200048006F006C006F002000430061007300740065007200200069007300200074006F00200062006C0061006D0065002C00200079006F00750020007300610079002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How peculiar—I could have sworn that I heard\naccusations of a “weird attitude” and “cheating.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I, err... I was just voicing some minor, pent-up\ngrievances, that’s all!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nothing that cannot be easily remedied by a\nrousing Pokémon battle, I assure you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see. It seems you require further teaching.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300650065002E0020004900740020007300650065006D007300200079006F007500200072006500710075006900720065002000660075007200740068006500720020007400650061006300680069006E0067002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Now then, Lebanne. Let us battle—you and my\nhologram versus my dear<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Is that agreeable to you,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004900730020007400680061007400200061006700720065006500610062006C006500200074006F00200079006F0075002C000A0010000201000000003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let us begin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007400200075007300200062006500670069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please wait!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C00650061007300650020007700610069007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You cannot delay such a splendid battle, having\nme as both ally and opponent! We must begin!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Only an elite such as I could allow you to fight\nbeside and against me simultaneously!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Please battle against my hologram,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000050006C006500610073006500200062006100740074006C006500200061006700610069006E007300740020006D007900200068006F006C006F006700720061006D002C000A0010000201000000002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If we have a battle, Lady Jacinthe might forget all\nabout this!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490066002000770065002000680061007600650020006100200062006100740074006C0065002C0020004C0061006400790020004A006100630069006E0074006800650020006D006900670068007400200066006F007200670065007400200061006C006C000A00610062006F0075007400200074006800690073002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait a moment",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002000610020006D006F006D0065006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How vexing of you to keep me waiting... I expect\nan affirmative answer soon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "With Lebanne by my side, victory is assured!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570069007400680020004C006500620061006E006E00650020006200790020006D007900200073006900640065002C00200076006900630074006F0072007900200069007300200061007300730075007200650064002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you wanna help me, battle me! Come on!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F0075002000770061006E006E0061002000680065006C00700020006D0065002C00200062006100740074006C00650020006D0065002100200043006F006D00650020006F006E002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aw yeah! Maybe a concentrated attack on Lady\nJacinthe will make it so this never happened...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I could take on the whole world as long as I have\nyou on my team!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200063006F0075006C0064002000740061006B00650020006F006E0020007400680065002000770068006F006C006500200077006F0072006C00640020006100730020006C006F006E00670020006100730020004900200068006100760065000A0079006F00750020006F006E0020006D00790020007400650061006D002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is our responsibility as elites to guide the\nmasses, Clefable!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020006900730020006F0075007200200072006500730070006F006E0073006900620069006C00690074007900200061007300200065006C006900740065007300200074006F0020006700750069006400650020007400680065000A006D00610073007300650073002C00200043006C0065006600610062006C0065002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Time for our secret weapon! Mega Evolve so we\ncan drag these two, Dragalge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not even I quite understand how my hologram is\nable to use Mega Evolution!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As expected, victory is mine!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410073002000650078007000650063007400650064002C00200076006900630074006F007200790020006900730020006D0069006E0065002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now then, Lebanne. I assume your discontent\nstems from dissatisfaction with your current<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncircumstances, yes?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yet for the life of me, I cannot fathom why being\naround me would cause you such unhappiness.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s myself I’m unhappy with, Lady Jacinthe. I’m\nfrustrated that I can never defeat you...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "and that frustration came out in a...strange way. I\nmust be more diligent.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If that is how you feel, then I suppose we shall\nhave to train twice as hard as before!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "From now on, you can train by battling against me\nand my hologram—and grow twice as strong!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, please accept this as\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntoken<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmy<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthanks<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfor<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyour<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhelp today.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 23,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received additional color options for\nJacinthe’s Dress!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020006100640064006900740069006F006E0061006C00200063006F006C006F00720020006F007000740069006F006E007300200066006F0072000A004A006100630069006E0074006800652019007300200044007200650073007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I recommend adopting my hairstyle to complete\nthis ensemble.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007200650063006F006D006D0065006E0064002000610064006F007000740069006E00670020006D007900200068006100690072007300740079006C006500200074006F00200063006F006D0070006C006500740065000A007400680069007300200065006E00730065006D0062006C0065002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Facing off against my hologram has helped me\ntruly appreciate just how magnificent I am.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Despite being a hologram, I am still me—the one,\nthe only, the magnificent!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I need to work harder at keeping my grievances to\nmyself... Otherwise, things could get ugly.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    }
  ],
